    "notes": "CVE-2023-37466 (GHSA-cchq-frgv-rjh5, fixed 3.10.0): Promise.prototype.then sanitization bypass via @@species; the fix introduced resetPromiseSpecies() in setup-sandbox.js which restores the species. Residual: resetPromiseSpecies uses [].includes and Object.defineProperty, both overridable from inside the sandbox; overriding Object.defineProperty = () => {} defeats the reset -> CVE-2026-24120 (GHSA-qvjj-29qf-hp7p, fixed 3.10.5). Payloads (official PoCs): seed = the 3.9.19 Promise species escape; residual = the same with Object.defineProperty override. The escaped code reaches process.mainModule.require('child_process').execSync. Server runs payloads in the real vm2 sandbox per version; unhandledRejection/uncaughtException handlers keep the probe alive (the recursive stack() in the seed payload throws async RangeError when blocked). Built 2026-08-01.",
